cell 2,1 attrs=inverse
cell 2,3 attrs=inverse
cell 2,4 attrs=none
cell 3,1 attrs=none
test DECCARA in stream extent runs to the screen's edges, not the margins
spec VT510 DECCARA: "not affected by page margins"; DECSACE 0: the stream of character positions from the first position to the second, so the rows between are whole rows; vttest 11/156 expects the stream to wrap at the margins, which the manual does not say
known-fail: alacritty – no DECCARA, DECRARA or DECSACE: they are ignored
size 8 4
feed abcdefgh\r\nijklmnop\r\nqrstuvwx\r\nyzABCDEF\e[?69h\e[3;5s\e[2;3r\e[1;3;3;6;7$r
